title: Sync Climate Bar - Heated & Cooled Seat Icons
raw_community_title: Enable Cooled and/or Heated seats to climate bar above
category: Sync and Infotainment
platform: F-150
model_years: 2021-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: if you have heated & cooled seats  then use A
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-02-01
  mask: xxxx x*xx xx--
  notes: subtract 4 for cooled only, add 4 for 3 level heated only.
  nibble: 5
  hex_offset: '+4'
  bits:
  - bit: 3
    action: 1
    feature_name: Heated Seats HMI (HSHMI)
    target_state: HSHMI Heated and Cooled
  - bit: 2
    action: 0
    feature_name: Heated Seats HMI (HSHMI)
    target_state: HSHMI None (Hard buttons or No Heated or Cooled Seats)
